@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Blueprinting Layer Diagram

stack "Layer 5: Code (Final Implementation)" as L5
stack "Layer 4: Tests (Behavioral Guard)" as L4
stack "Layer 3: Patterns (Structural Logic)" as L3
stack "Layer 2: Pseudocode (Logic Flow)" as L2
stack "Layer 1: Skeleton (FileSystem Hierarchy)" as L1

L1 -[hidden]down-> L2
L2 -[hidden]down-> L3
L3 -[hidden]down-> L4
L4 -[hidden]down-> L5

note right of L1 : Folder structure & Empty files
note right of L2 : Step-by-step logic in comments
note right of L3 : Design patterns (Adapter, Service)
note right of L4 : Failing tests (Agent A)
note right of L5 : Passing implementation (Agent B)

@enduml
